URL: https://github.com/libffi/libffi/releases/download/v3.8.2/libffi-3.8.2.tar.gz ad67025851efb2e0562337057d1f7160686fe724ec7cfe83b9bed51c041eb6d9
Origname: libffi-3.8.2
Name: libffi

    libffi 3.8.2 with the Fil-C port (FFI_FILC ABI on x86_64 and aarch64).
diff --git a/libffi/Makefile.am b/libffi/Makefile.am
--- a/libffi/Makefile.am
